<section class="intro">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>What is Kin-Fusion?</h2>
    <p>Kin-Fusion is a community gathering of fusion dancers, DJs, and music lovers coming together for three days of dance, connection, and co-creation in the stunning beauty of Saltspring Island.</p>
    <p>This is a not-for-profit community event capped at about 90 people. Everyone who comes is asked to contribute in small ways — because we're all part of creating it together.</p>
    <p><strong>Food is provided</strong> by the event. Kids 12 and under attend free.</p>
    <p><a href="/about/">Learn more about Kin-Fusion &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

